<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<definitions xmlns="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:flowable="http://flowable.org/bpmn" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:omgdc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:omgdi="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" targetNamespace="http://www.flowable.org/test">
  <process id="model-approval-v1" name="Model Approval V1" isExecutable="true" flowable:candidateStarterGroups="ml-engineers,governance-admins">
    <documentation>Proceso de aprobación de Model ML - VERSIÓN OPTIMIZADA

ELEMENTOS AVANZADOS:
✅ ParallelGateway - Validaciones en paralelo (3x más rápido)
✅ BusinessRuleTask - Drools para decisión final
✅ Error Boundaries - Resiliencia ante fallos
✅ Timer Boundary - SLA 3 días en Governance Review
✅ MailTask - Notificaciones automáticas

PROPORCIÓN: 60% Automatizado - 40% HITL (ML Review + Governance Review)

FLUJO:
1. Start → Submit Request (User Task)
2. ParallelGateway → 3 validaciones simultáneas
3. Join → ML Engineer Review (User Task)
4. Governance Review (User Task) + Timer SLA 3 días
5. BusinessRuleTask (Drools scoring)
6. Decision → APPROVED / CONDITIONAL / REJECTED</documentation>
    <startEvent id="start" name="Inicio" />
    <userTask id="submitTask" name="Submit Model for Approval" flowable:candidateGroups="ml-engineers" flowable:formKey="plataforma/workflow/model-approval-request-form.zul" flowable:priority="60">
      <documentation>Usuario ML Engineer solicita aprobación del modelo.

Input:
- modelId, versionId
- approvalType: NEW_MODEL, VERSION_UPDATE, REDEPLOYMENT
- targetEnvironment: STAGING, PRODUCTION
- businessJustification</documentation>
    </userTask>
    <parallelGateway id="fork" name="Fork Validaciones" />
    <serviceTask id="performanceTask" name="Performance Validation" flowable:class="com.codeflowx.govern.workflow.delegates.ModelValidationDelegate">
      <documentation>Valida performance del modelo.
Llama a: leka-server-serving-evaluation
Output: performanceScore (0-100)</documentation>
    </serviceTask>
    <boundaryEvent id="perfError" name="Error" attachedToRef="performanceTask">
      <errorEventDefinition />
    </boundaryEvent>
    <scriptTask id="handlePerfError" name="Score Conservador" scriptFormat="javascript" flowable:autoStoreVariables="false">
      <script>execution.setVariable('performanceScore', 70);</script>
    </scriptTask>
    <serviceTask id="biasTask" name="Bias Detection" flowable:class="com.codeflowx.govern.workflow.delegates.BiasDetectionDelegate">
      <documentation>Detecta bias en modelo.
Llama a: leka-server-serving-evaluation
Output: biasScore (0-100)</documentation>
    </serviceTask>
    <serviceTask id="complianceTask" name="Compliance Check" flowable:class="com.codeflowx.govern.workflow.delegates.ComplianceCheckDelegate">
      <documentation>Verifica compliance regulatorio.
Output: complianceScore (0-100)</documentation>
    </serviceTask>
    <parallelGateway id="join" name="Join Validaciones" />
    <userTask id="mlReviewTask" name="ML Engineer Review" flowable:candidateGroups="ml-engineers,senior-ml-engineers" flowable:formKey="plataforma/workflow/model-ml-review-form.zul" flowable:priority="75">
      <documentation>Revisión técnica por ML Engineer.

Output:
- mlApproval: APPROVED, REJECTED, NEEDS_CHANGES
- reviewNotes</documentation>
    </userTask>
    <userTask id="govReviewTask" name="Governance Review" flowable:candidateGroups="governance-admins" flowable:formKey="plataforma/workflow/model-governance-review-form.zul" flowable:priority="75">
      <documentation>Revisión de governance (ética, riesgos, compliance).

Output:
- governanceApproval: APPROVED, REJECTED, CONDITIONAL
- riskAssessment: LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH</documentation>
    </userTask>
    <boundaryEvent id="govTimer" name="SLA 3 días" cancelActivity="false" attachedToRef="govReviewTask">
      <timerEventDefinition>
        <timeDuration>P3D</timeDuration>
      </timerEventDefinition>
    </boundaryEvent>
    <userTask id="slaReminder" name="SLA Reminder" flowable:candidateGroups="governance-leads" flowable:formKey="bpmn/model-approval-reminder-form.zul" flowable:priority="85">
      <documentation>Recordatorio SLA excedido (3 días).</documentation>
    </userTask>
    <businessRuleTask id="droolsScore" name="Calculate Final Decision (Drools)" flowable:ruleVariablesInput="${modelApprovalFact}" flowable:rules="model-approval-scoring" flowable:resultVariable="finalDecision">
      <documentation>Ejecuta reglas Drools para decisión final.

INPUT:
- ModelApprovalFact con:
  · performanceScore, biasScore, complianceScore
  · mlEngineerApproval, governanceApproval
  · targetEnvironment

DROOLS DRL: model-approval-scoring.drl (12 reglas)

OUTPUT:
- finalDecision: APPROVED / CONDITIONAL_APPROVAL / REJECTED
- minScore, confidenceLevel, justification
- requiresMonitoring</documentation>
    </businessRuleTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="gateway" name="Decisión Final" />
    <serviceTask id="approveTask" name="Mark Production Ready" flowable:class="com.codeflowx.govern.workflow.delegates.MarkModelProductionDelegate">
      <documentation>Marca modelo como listo para producción.</documentation>
    </serviceTask>
    <serviceTask id="mailApprove" name="Email: Model Approved" flowable:type="mail">
      <extensionElements>
        <flowable:field name="to">
          <flowable:expression>${approverEmail}</flowable:expression>
        </flowable:field>
        <flowable:field name="from">
          <flowable:string>governance@company.com</flowable:string>
        </flowable:field>
        <flowable:field name="subject">
          <flowable:expression>Model Approved: ${modelName}</flowable:expression>
        </flowable:field>
        <flowable:field name="html">
          <flowable:expression>Model approved for ${targetEnvironment}. Score: ${minScore}/100. Monitoring: ${requiresMonitoring}</flowable:expression>
        </flowable:field>
      </extensionElements>
    </serviceTask>
    <endEvent id="endApproved" name="Model Approved" />
    <serviceTask id="conditionalTask" name="Mark Conditional Approval" flowable:class="com.codeflowx.govern.workflow.delegates.MarkModelConditionalDelegate">
      <documentation>Marca modelo como aprobado CON CONDICIONES.
Requiere monitorización adicional.</documentation>
    </serviceTask>
    <serviceTask id="mailConditional" name="Email: Conditional Approval" flowable:type="mail">
      <extensionElements>
        <flowable:field name="to">
          <flowable:expression>${approverEmail}</flowable:expression>
        </flowable:field>
        <flowable:field name="from">
          <flowable:string>governance@company.com</flowable:string>
        </flowable:field>
        <flowable:field name="subject">
          <flowable:expression>Model Conditionally Approved: ${modelName}</flowable:expression>
        </flowable:field>
        <flowable:field name="html">
          <flowable:expression>Model conditionally approved. Enhanced monitoring REQUIRED. Score: ${minScore}/100</flowable:expression>
        </flowable:field>
      </extensionElements>
    </serviceTask>
    <endEvent id="endConditional" name="Conditional Approval" />
    <serviceTask id="rejectTask" name="Reject Model" flowable:class="com.codeflowx.govern.workflow.delegates.RejectModelDelegate">
      <documentation>Marca modelo como rechazado.</documentation>
    </serviceTask>
    <serviceTask id="mailReject" name="Email: Model Rejected" flowable:type="mail">
      <extensionElements>
        <flowable:field name="to">
          <flowable:expression>${approverEmail}</flowable:expression>
        </flowable:field>
        <flowable:field name="from">
          <flowable:string>governance@company.com</flowable:string>
        </flowable:field>
        <flowable:field name="subject">
          <flowable:expression>Model Rejected: ${modelName}</flowable:expression>
        </flowable:field>
        <flowable:field name="html">
          <flowable:expression>Model rejected. Reason: ${justification}</flowable:expression>
        </flowable:field>
      </extensionElements>
    </serviceTask>
    <endEvent id="endRejected" name="Model Rejected" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow1" sourceRef="start" targetRef="submitTask" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow2" sourceRef="submitTask" targetRef="fork" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow3a" sourceRef="fork" targetRef="performanceTask" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow3b" sourceRef="fork" targetRef="biasTask" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow3c" sourceRef="fork" targetRef="complianceTask" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flowPerfError" sourceRef="perfError" targetRef="handlePerfError" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flowPerfErrorToJoin" sourceRef="handlePerfError" targetRef="join" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow4a" sourceRef="performanceTask" targetRef="join" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow4b" sourceRef="biasTask" targetRef="join" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow4c" sourceRef="complianceTask" targetRef="join" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow5" sourceRef="join" targetRef="mlReviewTask" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow6" sourceRef="mlReviewTask" targetRef="govReviewTask" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flowTimer" sourceRef="govTimer" targetRef="slaReminder" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flowReminder" sourceRef="slaReminder" targetRef="droolsScore" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow7" sourceRef="govReviewTask" targetRef="droolsScore" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flow8" sourceRef="droolsScore" targetRef="gateway" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flowApprove" name="APPROVED" sourceRef="gateway" targetRef="approveTask">
      <conditionExpression xsi:type="tFormalExpression">${finalDecision == 'APPROVED'}</conditionExpression>
    </sequenceFlow>
    <sequenceFlow id="flowApprove2" sourceRef="approveTask" targetRef="mailApprove" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flowApprove3" sourceRef="mailApprove" targetRef="endApproved" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flowConditional" name="CONDITIONAL" sourceRef="gateway" targetRef="conditionalTask">
      <conditionExpression xsi:type="tFormalExpression">${finalDecision == 'CONDITIONAL_APPROVAL'}</conditionExpression>
    </sequenceFlow>
    <sequenceFlow id="flowConditional2" sourceRef="conditionalTask" targetRef="mailConditional" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flowConditional3" sourceRef="mailConditional" targetRef="endConditional" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flowReject" name="REJECTED" sourceRef="gateway" targetRef="rejectTask">
      <conditionExpression xsi:type="tFormalExpression">${finalDecision == 'REJECTED'}</conditionExpression>
    </sequenceFlow>
    <sequenceFlow id="flowReject2" sourceRef="rejectTask" targetRef="mailReject" />
    <sequenceFlow id="flowReject3" sourceRef="mailReject" targetRef="endRejected" />
  </process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="BPMNDiagram_model-approval-v1">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="BPMNPlane_model-approval-v1" bpmnElement="model-approval-v1">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_start" bpmnElement="start">
        <omgdc:Bounds x="50" y="299" width="35" height="35" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_submitTask" bpmnElement="submitTask">
        <omgdc:Bounds x="150" y="287" width="131" height="67" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_fork" bpmnElement="fork">
        <omgdc:Bounds x="340" y="297" width="40" height="40" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_performanceTask" bpmnElement="performanceTask">
        <omgdc:Bounds x="440" y="50" width="130" height="75" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_biasTask" bpmnElement="biasTask">
        <omgdc:Bounds x="450" y="287" width="120" height="60" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_complianceTask" bpmnElement="complianceTask">
        <omgdc:Bounds x="450" y="489" width="120" height="60" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="BPMNShape_join" bpmnElement="join">
